OL,3,GNEWSASmartphones could become illegal
OL,4,Ain NI schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland could ban smartphones
OL,7,Fin schools by law, following a move
OL,8,Fmade earlier this year in England.
OL,10,FEducation Minister Paul Givan is
OL,11,Fconsulting on whether to introduce the
OL,12,Flegislation.
OL,14,FGivan said the move was not
OL,15,F"anti-technology" but about making
OL,16,Fschools "safe and supportive."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
