OL,3,GNEWSASmartphones could become illegal
OL,4,Ain NI schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he wanted children and young
OL,7,Fpeople to be able to "focus on
OL,8,Flearning" and plans to issue revised
OL,9,Fguidance to schools on preventing
OL,10,Fpupils using their phones ahead of the
OL,11,Fnew academic year.
